[{"source":"edge","severity":"note","category":"boundary","title":"W9 envelope bound uses WINDOW=1800 but the count gate spans 1801 ticks (1200..=3000 inclusive, plus post-surge tick 3000)","location":"core/demand_test.odin:518-549,593","evidence":"SURGE_START :: u64(1200)\n\tSURGE_END :: u64(3000)\n\tWINDOW := SURGE_END - SURGE_START\n...\n\tfor tick in u64(1)..=SURGE_END {\n...\n\t\t\tif p.class == 1 && p.spawn_tick == tick {\n\t\t\t\tstream_spawned += 1\n\t\t\t\tif tick >= SURGE_START {\n...\n\t\t\t\t\tper_tick_host_burst[p.src] += 1\n\t\t\t\t\tper_host_spawns[p.src] += 1\n...\n\t\tbound := ceil_cap + accrue * WINDOW / 1000\n\t\tif per_host_spawns[s.topology.node_id[ns]] > bound { credit_ok = false }","detail":"Counted window is ticks 1200..=3000 (1801 ticks; set_piece_active ends at tick<3000, so 3000 is post-surge base) while the bound accrues only 1800 ticks. A campus (accrue 2500) can theoretically source (3000+2500×1801)/1000 = 4505 > bound 4503 — latent false failure.","recommended_fix":"Gate counting on tick >= SURGE_START && tick < SURGE_END (matching set_piece_active's [start, end) window), or define WINDOW as the inclusive count SURGE_END-SURGE_START+1 used by both the gate and the bound."},{"source":"edge","severity":"note","category":"coverage-gap","title":"W9 per-tick burst-ceiling check no longer runs on pre-surge ticks 1..1199 (previously checked every tick)","location":"core/demand_test.odin:541-549","evidence":"for p in s.flow.packets {\n\t\t\tif p.class == 1 && p.spawn_tick == tick {\n\t\t\t\tstream_spawned += 1\n\t\t\t\tif tick >= SURGE_START {\n...\n\t\t\t\t\tper_tick_host_burst[p.src] += 1\n (pre-diff, git HEAD~1: per_tick_host_burst[p.src] += 1 was unconditional and `for src, n in per_tick_host_burst { if n > 2 { burst_ok = false } }` ran every tick 1..=3000; now the map stays empty for tick < 1200 so the ceiling loop at :554 checks nothing)","detail":"The changed lines moved both burst counters inside `if tick >= SURGE_START`, so the per-tick ceiling assertion (now `if u64(n) > ceil_cap`) is vacuous for ticks 1..1199 — a pre-surge over-cap regression would pass this pin.","recommended_fix":"Keep per_tick_host_burst population unconditional; only the WINDOW-scoped per_host_spawns envelope needs the tick >= SURGE_START gate."}]
